  "_about": [
    "Waze's map in the car page's Graphite look: neutral grey land, white roads by day and dark roads by night, the route in the theme blue; traffic, pins and reports stay Waze's.",
    "An ATL file overlay manifest (ATL_FILE_OVERLAYS, see the fork's src/api-impl-jni/file_overlays.c). Waze reads its map palette from the Lua files it unpacks into its data folder; ATL serves Waze a copy with these replacements, in memory. The files on disk never change.",
    "Applied only for the (versionCode, sha256 of the original file) pairs under each entry's 'verified'. Any other Waze version or file contents: Waze's own colours, and Settings > Waze interface says so (services/api/api.py).",
